      "text": "Functional\n- upload file\n- download file\n- share file\n- automatic file sync \n\nNon-functional\n- availability > consistency\n- low latency in upload/download \n- upload large files\n- sync accuracy",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional\n- upload file\n- download file\n- share file\n- automatic file sync \n\nNon-functional\n- availability > consistency\n- low latency in upload/download \n- upload large files\n- sync accuracy",
